        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana R2000, R-Series Classic Spring Toilet Tissue Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe R Series Toilet Paper Holder is made with the attention to quality for which Deltana is known. The classic mounts look will look great in any traditional decor. This wall mounted toilet tissue dispenser is made out of brass and is available in a wide array of finishes, so you'll be sure to find just the right one to match your decor.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2000-specifications.gif?v=1704354581\" width=\"505\" height=\"256\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana R2000 Toilet Paper Holder Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana R Series\"><b>Deltana R-Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the R Series Solid Brass Double Post Toilet Paper Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Recommended Installation Distance (c.c.): 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Arm Length (half): 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2000.pdf?v=1704262289\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana R2000 Toilet Paper Holder Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 toilet tissue holder, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
