                "title": "Solid Brass Toilet Paper Holder, Deltana R2000",
                "description": "Deltana R-Series Toilet Paper Holder - The R Series Toilet Paper Holder is made with the attention to quality for which Deltana is known. The classic mounts look will look great in any traditional decor. This wall mounted toilet tissue dispenser is made out of brass and is available in a wide array of finishes, so you'll be sure to find just the right one to match your decor.",
